<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Spicer Mitchell 15-month shr shows loss.</title>
<headline>Spicer Mitchell 15-month shr shows loss.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>15 months ended Dec 31 versus 12 months to September 30, 1996.</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, attrib (cts)     6.59 (loss) vs 3.18 profit</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)   3.40 (loss) vs 6.37</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		 -	     vs -</p>
<p>    Attrib income	   3.71	  vs 1.75 profit</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		   2.60	  vs 4.38 profit</p>
<p>    Tax			 2.58	  vs 2.11</p>
