<p>    Turnover		  232.92	vs 182.09</p>
<p>Full name: Spicer Mitchell Holdings Ltd (engineering)</p>
<p>NOTE - The group has changed its financial year end to December 31.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
